        "id": 1259838
      },
      "writtenOn": "2019-06-12T18:26:17Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "isn\u0027t \" \u003e DRAM AT \u003e DRAM\" the same as just \"\u003e DRAM\"? Isn\u0027t DRAM implied for the LMA if it is not specified?",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 465,
        "startChar": 13,
        "endLine": 465,
        "endChar": 22
      },
      "revId": "4e8427db0b0717edfe5d355cf09f6dea3dde2e17",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba",
      "unresolved": true
    },
    {
      "key": {
        "uuid": "1db175cf_f315338b",
        "filename": "core/cortex-m/ec.lds.S",
        "patchSetId": 7
      },
      "lineNbr": 465,
      "author": {
        "id": 1182824
      },
      "writtenOn": "2019-06-13T03:12:59Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "No, it\u0027s different if you have specified VMA address at the first line of section declaration.\n\nIf we are using \u0027\u003e DRAM\u0027 only, we have:\n\n$ arm-none-eabi-objdump -h build/kukui_scp/RW/ec.RW.elf\n\nIdx Name          Size      VMA       LMA       File off  Algn\n 5 .dram.text    00000048  10000000  10000000  00030000  2**3\n                 CONTENTS, ALLOC, LOAD, READONLY, CODE\n 6 .dram.data    00000014  1000005c  1000005c  0003005c  2**0\n                 CONTENTS, ALLOC, LOAD, DATA\n 7 .dram.bss     00000004  10000070  10000070  00030070  2**0\n                 ALLOC\n\nYou can see the .dram.data LMA and VMA are the same (0x1000005c).\n\nWhat we need is, they should be at the different address(VMA 0x1000005c, LMA 0x10000048).\n\n$ arm-none-eabi-objdump -h build/kukui_scp/RW/ec.RW.elf\n\nIdx Name          Size      VMA       LMA       File off  Algn\n  5 .dram.text    00000048  10000000  10000000  00030000  2**3 \n                  CONTENTS, ALLOC, LOAD, READONLY, CODE        \n  6 .dram.data    00000014  1000005c  10000048  0003005c  2**0 \n                  CONTENTS, ALLOC, LOAD, DATA                  \n  7 .dram.bss     00000004  10000070  10000070  00030070  2**0 \n                  ALLOC",
      "parentUuid": "49e25f67_2116c4a6",
